{"overview":"کابو دانش‌آموز دبیرستانی با لکنت زبان است که در بیان احساساتش مشکل دارد؛ او به همکلاسی‌اش واندا که بدون نگرانی از نگاه دیگران به رقص می‌پردازد، جذب می‌شود. برای یافتن یک شکل آزاد از بیان، کابو به دنیای ناآشنا رقص قدم می‌گذارد.","tagline":"","overview_en":"Kabo is a high school student with a stutter who struggles to express his feelings. He finds himself drawn to his classmate Wanda, who pursues dance without worrying about how others see her. Seeking a form of freestyle expression, Kabo takes on the unfamiliar world of dance.","tagline_en":"","runtime":23,"status":"Ended","seasons":[{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":12,"y":2025,"poster":"/rncjyi75KiXCUTuIvjDUYv2rD4H.jpg"}],"episodes":12,"crew":[],"crew_en":[],"countries":["JP"],"cast":[{"name":"内山昂輝","role":"Kaboku 'Kabo' Kotani (voice)","photo":"/sllSm3iZZWVLTBrDZQRtWrZUfEj.jpg","en":"Koki Uchiyama"},{"name":"羊宮妃那","role":"Hikari Wanda (voice)","photo":"/tOy21NTNnKuZG48JCL673tTP16z.jpg","en":"Hina Youmiya"}],"trailer":"rMXCaF4FtxE","watch":{"US":{"link":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/262259/watch?locale=US","p":[{"n":"Hulu","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/44uAnmSqvA4yBOdbPWN8YgQHjWm.png"}]},"GB":{"link":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/262259/watch?locale=GB","p":[{"n":"Disney Plus","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/5eZ872CghnHFLB1j8grszbrx0dx.png"}]},"CA":{"link":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/262259/watch?locale=CA","p":[{"n":"Disney Plus","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/5eZ872CghnHFLB1j8grszbrx0dx.png"}]},"DE":{"link":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/262259/watch?locale=DE","p":[{"n":"Disney Plus","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/5eZ872CghnHFLB1j8grszbrx0dx.png"}]},"TR":{"link":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/262259/watch?locale=TR","p":[{"n":"Disney Plus","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/5eZ872CghnHFLB1j8grszbrx0dx.png"}]}},"recs":["s65336"],"tmdb":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/262259"}